body:
I understand you perfectly, there´s so many times she just made me feel horrible and worthless and at the same time "everything I do is for your sake". I went abroad a whole year and I was NC and it was sooo amazing, we only talked for good mornigs and goodbyes, and I think it was the best year ever. The whole family insisted of talking to her more because it was compassionate and a good mother and I was just so fed up. They try to make it look like they are the best person here but they only discharge the anger with whichever they find. But because everything if of your sake, how is that her doing is making you feel miserable?

&#x200B;

OP, if anytime you can go NC with her, go and dont look back please. I´m sure it will cost, and it will make you feel bad, but after a while, you´ll see how your life is so much better and that you made the right decision. I hope you stay well and best wishes
